{"message":"Your account is verified. I found two credit cards—Gold Rewards Card and Business Gold Rewards Card—and multiple Costco and Amazon transactions. Before I file disputes, please identify the approximately eight charges by providing each transaction’s date, amount, and card type (Gold or Business Gold). Also specify the issue for each: unauthorized/fraudulent, duplicate, incorrect amount, goods/services not received, item not as described, subscription still charging, or refund not processed.

For each non-fraud charge, tell me whether you contacted the merchant first. Please also provide the date you first noticed these issues and your preferred resolution: full refund, partial refund, or reversal of charge.

Because you reported fraud, I can help secure the affected card. Please confirm whether you want the affected card cancelled and replaced, and whether the fraud involves the Gold card, Business Gold card, or both. Cancelling and replacing a card will stop it from being used for new purchases."}

